       "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "<div class=\"description\">\nThis is a collection of annual reports published by Singapore Improvement Trust (SIT) after the end of the Second World War. They shed light on the Master Plan (housing policies), maps, statistics, land usage, finance information, illustrations of different types of housing development, staff strength and etc, in the period leading up to the self-governance of Singapore in 1959. The annual reports help us understand the changes and pace of housing development in Singapore before 1965.</div>",
